<h1>Patient Portal API — Documentation</h1>
<p>REST + WebSocket API for the AKOS MD patient portal. It serves patients, HR</p>
<p>administrators, and care navigators, covering authentication, profiles,</p>
<p>appointments, tele‑consults, lab tests, prescriptions, assessments, chat,</p>
<p>notifications, and vital monitoring.</p>
<ul>
<li><b>Package:</b> <code>akosmd_patient</code> v1.0.0</li>
<li><b>Stack:</b> Node.js · Express 4 · Sequelize (MySQL) · Socket.IO · JWT</li>
<li><b>Entry point:</b> <a href="index.js">index.js</a></li>
<li><b>Default port:</b> <code>3001</code> (override with <code>PORT</code>)</li>
</ul>
<hr/>
